@startuml sequence_add_tile_catalog
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Add-Tile Catalog Filtered By Mode

actor User
participant DashboardShellComponent as Shell
participant TileRegistryService as Reg
participant "Add-Tile Dialog" as Dlg

User -> Shell: tap FAB (live mode)
Shell -> Reg: tilesForMode('live')
Reg --> Shell: TileManifest[]
Shell -> Dlg: open with manifests
User -> Dlg: pick a tile
Dlg -> Shell: chosen id
Shell -> Reg: componentFor(id, 'live')
Reg --> Shell: Type<Component>

@enduml
